  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Once per long rest, you reach into the living pattern of a willing creature or one that is incapacitated and make a permanent change to its biology. This alteration is not a curse and cannot be dispelled, counterspelled, or removed by <em>Dispel Magic</em> or <em>Remove Curse</em>.</p><p>You may grant darkvision, a natural weapon, resistance to one damage type, water breathing, or a climb or swim speed. You may remove a vulnerability, a racial trait, a sense, or the effects of a curse or disease by rewriting the body's response to it.</p>",
